1
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:13,972
Hau hotza!

2
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,682
Udazkena iristear da.

3
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,978
Oso gogoko dut urtaro aldaketa sentitzea.

4
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:21,938
Beri esaten duzu hori.

5
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:25,191
{\an8}Udako ospakizunak eta uda-giroa
gogoko ditut.

6
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:28,319
{\an8}Eta atsegin dut sentitzen duzun
freskotasun hezea

7
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:31,072
{\an8}udako gauetan paseotxo bat ematean…

8
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:36,202
Baina horrelako uneak, hotza egiten hasi
eta urtaro aldaketa nabari denean,

9
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:39,039
gehien atsegin ditudanak dira.

10
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:41,207
{\an8}Ulertzen dizudala uste dut.

11
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:44,127
Udako entrenamendu
gogor baten ostean bezala,

12
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,005
esaten duzunean: "Indartsuagoa naiz ja?".

13
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:51,176
Agian oraindik
sentsazio hori dudalako da. Ez duzu uste?

14
00:00:51,259 --> 00:00:53,595
Ahaztu esandakoa. Ez dut ezer ulertzen.

15
00:00:53,678 --> 00:00:54,929
Nola ezetz?

16
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,021
Udazkena da.

17
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,940
Noiz da zure urtebetetzea?

18
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:08,485
Zerbait oparituko didazu ala?

19
00:01:08,568 --> 00:01:10,820
Baina ez da ezer berezirik izango…

20
00:01:11,529 --> 00:01:13,114
{\an8}<i>Irailak 29an da.</i>

21
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,200
{\an8}<i>Gutxi falta da.</i>

22
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:18,119
<i>Laster bere urtebetetzea da.</i>

23
00:01:18,203 --> 00:01:19,204
<i>Baina…</i>

24
00:01:19,788 --> 00:01:20,789
{\an8}Bale.

25
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:23,708
{\an8}Harengandik urrunduko naiz.

26
00:01:24,584 --> 00:01:27,462
<i>Asertiboki jokatuz esan nion hori, baina…</i>

27
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:30,924
<i>Zenbateraino urrundu behar dut?</i>

28
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:33,176
<i>Ez genuen mugarik adostu.</i>

29
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:35,970
<i>Eman diezaioket
urtebetetze opari bat ala ez?</i>

30
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:37,055
<i>Zorionak!</i>

31
00:01:37,889 --> 00:01:40,225
<i>Eta modu ez oso serio batean bada?</i>

32
00:01:40,308 --> 00:01:44,479
<i>Berak hainbeste eman dit,
mesedea bueltatu nahi nioke.</i>

33
00:01:45,855 --> 00:01:50,735
<i>Asteburuan ez zen institutura joan
eta apur bat kezkatuta nauka.</i>

34
00:01:51,361 --> 00:01:53,613
<i>Ondo al dagoen galdetu nahi diot,</i>

35
00:01:54,447 --> 00:01:57,075
<i>baina ezin dut.</i>

36
00:02:01,329 --> 00:02:02,330
2. MAILA, 2. GELA

37
00:02:02,413 --> 00:02:03,706
Zer? Benetan?

38
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:07,001
Kurikirekin moztu duzu?

39
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:43,932
HOGEITA BIGARREN ATALA: INFLEXIO-PUNTUAK

40
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:47,143
EGUN BATZUK LEHENAGO

41
00:03:47,769 --> 00:03:49,395
<i>Ondo zaude?</i>

42
00:03:51,731 --> 00:03:54,150
<i>Bai, lasai, orain ondo nago.</i>

43
00:03:58,238 --> 00:04:00,323
MOMOKA, HITZ EGIN BEHAR DUGU

44
00:04:00,406 --> 00:04:01,658
<i>Orain arte…</i>

45
00:04:02,617 --> 00:04:03,868
Moztu egin nahi dut.

46
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:05,912
Bale.

47
00:04:07,038 --> 00:04:11,793
{\an8}<i>Pragmatikoki jokatu izan dut
horixe nahi zutela uste nuelako.</i>

48
00:04:11,876 --> 00:04:15,213
<i>Errazagoa da
erabakiak besteek hartzen dituztenean.</i>

49
00:04:16,381 --> 00:04:19,008
<i>Erabakia nik hartzen ez badut,</i>

50
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:20,969
<i>porrota ez da nire errua.</i>

51
00:04:21,761 --> 00:04:23,179
<i>Uzten banaute,</i>

52
00:04:23,846 --> 00:04:25,682
<i>ez naiz ni mina eragiten duena.</i>

53
00:04:26,516 --> 00:04:28,559
<i>Jendearen espektatibak betez gero,</i>

54
00:04:29,143 --> 00:04:31,771
<i>ez naiz erruduna,
ezta istorioko gaiztoa ere.</i>

55
00:04:32,355 --> 00:04:35,817
<i>Horrela jokatzen dut
ez dudalako errurik eduki nahi.</i>

56
00:04:36,901 --> 00:04:39,070
{\an8}IRAKURRITA

57
00:04:39,779 --> 00:04:44,367
<i>Nork esango zuen norbaitekin moztea
hain gogorra izango zenik?</i>

58
00:04:45,618 --> 00:04:47,912
Ezer gertatu ez balitz bezala zaude.

59
00:04:48,454 --> 00:04:50,373
Lotsagarri hori. Minduta nago.

60
00:04:50,456 --> 00:04:51,666
NI LEHEN…

61
00:04:54,711 --> 00:04:56,921
<i>Besteen iritziak kezkatzen ninduen</i>

62
00:04:57,005 --> 00:05:00,550
<i>eta haiek nahi zutena egiten nuen.</i>

63
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:03,553
<i>Eskua sartzen nuen
neure buruarekin ondo sentitzeko,</i>

64
00:05:03,636 --> 00:05:06,389
<i>eta gero
arreta neureganatzeaz gozatzen nuen.</i>

65
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:11,227
<i>"Ikusten? Ondo dago, zuzenena da".
Edo hori uste nuen nik.</i>

66
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:14,272
<i>Baina, berez…</i>

67
00:05:15,023 --> 00:05:16,274
Badakizu zer, Minato?

68
00:05:17,066 --> 00:05:19,777
Ez daukazu nortasun propiorik.

69
00:05:20,862 --> 00:05:22,613
<i>Oskola hutsa nintzen,</i>

70
00:05:23,406 --> 00:05:25,867
<i>beste pertsonekin betetzen zena.</i>

71
00:05:27,869 --> 00:05:28,870
<i>Desastre…</i>

72
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,913
<i>hutsa naiz.</i>

73
00:05:32,874 --> 00:05:34,625
MOMOKA, HITZ EGIN BEHAR DUGU

74
00:05:34,709 --> 00:05:36,294
<i>Hitz egin nahi du.</i>

75
00:05:36,919 --> 00:05:38,963
<i>Irakurri nuen bezain laster,</i>

76
00:05:39,672 --> 00:05:42,050
<i>banekien zeri buruz hitz egin nahi zuen.</i>

77
00:05:42,717 --> 00:05:46,763
<i>Irteten hasi ginenetik,
gero eta urduriago nago.</i>

78
00:05:50,016 --> 00:05:52,268
<i>Kito. Gaurkoz nahikoa da.</i>

79
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:57,106
<i>Gainera, gogor saiatu ere, ez da ohartzen.</i>

80
00:05:58,316 --> 00:06:02,320
<i>Lehen nigatik ahalegintzen nintzen,
baina orain ja ezin dut.</i>

81
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:05,323
<i>Onarpen ezak
nire segurtasuna murrizten du.</i>

82
00:06:06,282 --> 00:06:08,910
<i>Neure horretan jarraitzen nuen</i>

83
00:06:08,993 --> 00:06:11,579
<i>amorrua diodan
neska klase horretan ez bihurtzearren.</i>

84
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:17,293
<i>baina izan nahi ez dudan pertsona batean
bihurtzen ari naizela uste dut.</i>

85
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:20,463
<i>Eta…</i>

86
00:06:21,089 --> 00:06:22,382
<i>zeharo nazkatu naiz.</i>

87
00:06:35,728 --> 00:06:36,896
Moztu behar dugu.

88
00:06:38,481 --> 00:06:40,858
<i>Bai. Banekien nik.</i>

89
00:06:41,734 --> 00:06:44,904
Utzi nahi nauzu
gogoko duzun neskaren atzetik joateko?

90
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,281
Ez.

91
00:06:47,907 --> 00:06:49,242
Ez da horregatik.

92
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:52,078
Ez da zugatik.

93
00:06:53,454 --> 00:06:55,039
Nigatik da.

94
00:06:57,208 --> 00:07:00,795
Elkarrekin jarraitu arren,
ezin dut aldatu.

95
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:04,090
Ezin naiz izan zuk nahi duzun mutil hori.

96
00:07:06,217 --> 00:07:08,052
<i>Gogoko dudala uste dut.</i>

97
00:07:08,719 --> 00:07:11,055
<i>Zoriontsu izan dadila nahi dut.</i>

98
00:07:12,265 --> 00:07:13,266
<i>Baina…</i>

99
00:07:13,891 --> 00:07:17,603
<i>ez dut uste
nik zoriontsu egingo dudanik.</i>

100
00:07:19,147 --> 00:07:23,317
<i>Ez dut zoriontsu "egin" nahi.
Zoriontsua izan dadila nahi dut.</i>

101
00:07:24,777 --> 00:07:28,656
Ez dut uste
sentitzen dudana maitasuna denik.

102
00:07:29,824 --> 00:07:30,825
Sentitzen dut.

103
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:36,622
Banekien…

104
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:39,750
Banekien horrela sentitzen zinela!

105
00:07:39,834 --> 00:07:40,835
Ergel halakoa!

106
00:07:40,918 --> 00:07:45,089
Banekien ez ninduzula gogoko.
Eta behartuta sentitzen zinela.

107
00:07:45,173 --> 00:07:46,966
Beti jakin dut.

108
00:07:47,049 --> 00:07:49,594
Ez dakizu zein gogorra izan den niretzat!

109
00:07:52,597 --> 00:07:53,598
Sentitzen dut.

110
00:07:54,223 --> 00:07:55,475
Lehenago esan banizu…

111
00:07:55,558 --> 00:07:57,977
Ez esan hobe elkarrekin ibili ez bagina.

112
00:08:00,146 --> 00:08:03,316
Ez egin uko guztiari.

113
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:11,449
Nahiago nuke entzutea
beste pertsona bat gustatzen zaizula.

114
00:08:12,492 --> 00:08:15,119
Baina "ez da zugatik,
nigatik baizik" esatea,

115
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:18,623
erabakia zuk hartu izana,
niri kontsultatu gabe,

116
00:08:18,706 --> 00:08:22,752
zure arazoekin lagundu ahal dizudala
uste ez duzula esatea bezala da,

117
00:08:23,336 --> 00:08:26,506
Zure bihotza
zabaldu nahi ez diozun norbait naizela.

118
00:08:28,591 --> 00:08:29,592
{\an8}Baina berdin dit.

119
00:08:30,426 --> 00:08:33,137
<i>Nazkatu naiz
hau guztiaz kezkatuta ibiltzeaz.</i>

120
00:08:34,388 --> 00:08:38,518
<i>Jarraitu horrela,
bihotza itxita izanda, niri bost.</i>

121
00:08:44,857 --> 00:08:45,942
PANP

122
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:48,819
Bale. Ulertuta.

123
00:08:49,946 --> 00:08:50,947
Amaitu da.

124
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:53,574
Inozo halakoa.

125
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:04,627
<i>Amaitu da.</i>

126
00:09:06,462 --> 00:09:09,382
<i>Akabo. Azkenean amaitu da.</i>

127
00:09:10,299 --> 00:09:13,219
<i>Gezurra esango nuke
ondo nagoela esango banu,</i>

128
00:09:13,302 --> 00:09:17,974
<i>baina arindua nago,
kezkatua egotearena amaitu delako.</i>

129
00:09:18,849 --> 00:09:20,768
<i>Bai, ondo egongo naiz.</i>

130
00:09:21,269 --> 00:09:22,520
<i>Eskerrak amaitu den.</i>

131
00:09:23,062 --> 00:09:24,272
<i>Horri eutsiko diot.</i>

132
00:09:27,775 --> 00:09:29,735
Argazkiak ezabatuko ditut.

133
00:09:36,325 --> 00:09:39,287
<i>Udako oporretan hasi ginenez,</i>

134
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:42,039
<i>asko hitz egin genuen
eta argazki asko ditugu.</i>

135
00:09:45,501 --> 00:09:47,378
<i>Zeinen guapoa den, egia esan.</i>

136
00:09:47,461 --> 00:09:50,464
{\an8}<i>Ez, ez hasi horrekin, neska!</i>

137
00:09:52,925 --> 00:09:57,763
{\an8}<i>Film hau ikusi nahi nuela
esan nuela gogoratu zuen.</i>

138
00:09:58,556 --> 00:10:00,641
{\an8}<i>Eta hona joan nahi nuela.</i>

139
00:10:03,477 --> 00:10:07,898
<i>Eta berandura arte esna geratzen zen
telefonoz hitz egin nahi nuenean.</i>

140
00:10:08,774 --> 00:10:11,736
<i>Elkarrekin primeran pasa genuen.</i>

141
00:10:13,362 --> 00:10:14,655
Minato.

142
00:10:15,489 --> 00:10:16,907
Aizu, gogoko nauzu?

143
00:10:17,491 --> 00:10:18,951
{\an8}Bai, gogoko zaitut.

144
00:10:19,035 --> 00:10:20,077
{\an8}Zer gogoko duzu?

145
00:10:20,161 --> 00:10:23,831
{\an8}Zeure buruaz ziur zaudela,
nekaezina zarela, argia.

146
00:10:23,914 --> 00:10:27,418
{\an8}Konplimendu anbiguoak dira, ez?

147
00:10:28,836 --> 00:10:30,296
Ona da zuhurra izatea.

148
00:10:31,964 --> 00:10:35,551
<i>Gorroto nuen
panpina bat bezala tratatua izatea,</i>

149
00:10:36,886 --> 00:10:38,721
<i>norbaiten loreontzia izatea,</i>

150
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:43,142
<i>eta nire fisikoagatik
jendeak niri buruzko uste bat garatzea.</i>

151
00:10:43,225 --> 00:10:44,560
HAU GUSTATUKO ZAIZU

152
00:10:44,644 --> 00:10:45,686
BAI, ZER POLITA!

153
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:46,771
<i>Baina berak…</i>

154
00:10:47,813 --> 00:10:51,651
<i>benetan nolakoa nintzen zekien.
Ni ezagutzen saiatu zen.</i>

155
00:10:52,818 --> 00:10:54,195
<i>Eta halere,</i>

156
00:10:55,988 --> 00:10:57,406
<i>ez nau ni aukeratu.</i>

157
00:10:59,659 --> 00:11:04,205
<i>Zergatik ikusten ditut gauza onak orain,
behin amaitu denean?</i>

158
00:11:05,122 --> 00:11:09,335
<i>Zergatik ez nintzen ohartu
zein jatorra zen elkarrekin geundenean?</i>

159
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:14,924
<i>Gabezietan zentratu
eta haserretu beharrean,</i>

160
00:11:15,591 --> 00:11:19,595
<i>eskertuta egon behar nuen
nirekin hain adeitsua eta ona izateagatik.</i>

161
00:11:19,679 --> 00:11:22,098
Soilik zure interesen alde jokatuz gero,

162
00:11:23,015 --> 00:11:25,101
falta zaizkizun gauzetan
jarriko duzu arreta.

163
00:11:26,227 --> 00:11:28,854
Eta zorigaiztokoa izango zara.

164
00:11:31,691 --> 00:11:35,111
AMORRATURIK

165
00:11:38,739 --> 00:11:39,782
Bai zera.

166
00:11:39,865 --> 00:11:42,910
Baina Amamiyari beti uzten diote, ez?

167
00:11:42,993 --> 00:11:46,372
Agian adarrak jarri dizkio
eskaileretako neska horrekin?

168
00:11:46,455 --> 00:11:47,873
Kabroi hutsa da.

169
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:50,459
Momoka.

170
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:53,921
Esnatu. Goazen etxera.

171
00:11:54,004 --> 00:11:55,381
Tira, animatu.

172
00:11:55,464 --> 00:11:57,591
Zerbait goxoa erosiko dugu bidean?

173
00:11:57,675 --> 00:11:59,135
Gaur dietarik ez.

174
00:11:59,218 --> 00:12:01,887
Zatoz eta hustu barrena. Bota dena.

175
00:12:03,931 --> 00:12:05,141
Eskerrik asko.

176
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:06,642
PANP

177
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:10,020
Hau ez da espero nuena.

178
00:12:10,104 --> 00:12:11,897
PENAK JATEN ITOKO DITUGU

179
00:12:12,898 --> 00:12:13,899
Badakizue zer?

180
00:12:14,608 --> 00:12:18,279
Hurrengo harremanean,
neure burua gehiago maitatu behar dut.

181
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:21,741
Naizen bezalakoa izatea maite dut

182
00:12:22,450 --> 00:12:26,412
eta horrelaxe maiteko nauen norbait
aurkituko dut, soilik ni begiko duena.

183
00:12:29,707 --> 00:12:33,127
Eta hotz nabaritzen badut,
berehala utziko dut.

184
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,921
Eta berak usten banau, niri bost,

185
00:12:36,005 --> 00:12:38,424
gustu onik ez duela esan nahiko du eta.

186
00:12:39,425 --> 00:12:42,428
Horixe da izango naizen neska klasea.

187
00:12:45,598 --> 00:12:46,932
- Oso ondo.
- Oso ondo.

188
00:12:47,016 --> 00:12:48,017
BAI HORIXE!

189
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:50,394
Ongi ikusia! Aupa zu, neska!

190
00:12:51,479 --> 00:12:53,564
Oso pikante dago.

191
00:12:53,647 --> 00:12:56,567
Baina zer goxoa.

192
00:12:56,650 --> 00:12:57,860
Animo, neska!

193
00:12:57,943 --> 00:12:58,944
GYOSHO BEROAK

194
00:13:00,654 --> 00:13:03,365
<i>Amamiyak eta Momokak moztu egin dute.</i>

195
00:13:03,449 --> 00:13:04,450
2. MAILA, 2. GELA

196
00:13:04,533 --> 00:13:05,868
<i>Bat-batekoa izan da.</i>

197
00:13:06,827 --> 00:13:10,122
<i>Pozik egon nahi nuke,
nire egoera kontuan izanda, baina…</i>

198
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:15,127
Dedio, begiraiozue.
Oraingoan ez dago txorakerietarako.

199
00:13:15,711 --> 00:13:18,380
Harrezkero emozionalki hilda dago.

200
00:13:18,464 --> 00:13:20,758
Hino! Egizu zerbait!

201
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,093
Ezin dut ezer egin.

202
00:13:24,261 --> 00:13:25,262
<i>Lehen…</i>

203
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:31,227
Esker oneko nago gogoko izan nauelako.

204
00:13:32,186 --> 00:13:35,940
<i>Oso lasai zirudien
norbaitekin moztu ondoren.</i>

205
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,109
<i>Bera horrelakoa zela uste nuen, baina…</i>

206
00:13:40,653 --> 00:13:42,363
BEGI-KOLPEA

207
00:13:49,537 --> 00:13:52,373
Amamiya, gaur hobeto zaude?

208
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:55,793
AKITURIK

209
00:13:56,961 --> 00:13:58,921
{\an8}Bai. Ondo nago.

210
00:13:59,713 --> 00:14:00,714
{\an8}Eskerrik asko.

211
00:14:02,049 --> 00:14:04,093
Bai? Zer ondo.

212
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:08,597
Koyun!

213
00:14:08,681 --> 00:14:12,893
Kristoren zaila da hau!
Pertsona erabat desberdina dirudi.

214
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:13,978
<i>Moztu egin dugu.</i>

215
00:14:14,478 --> 00:14:16,730
{\an8}Midorikawak esan zuen bezala.

216
00:14:17,356 --> 00:14:19,567
Urrundu zaitez Minatorengandik.

217
00:14:20,484 --> 00:14:23,612
<i>Ez dut uste Momokaren ideia izan zenik.</i>

218
00:14:24,905 --> 00:14:26,198
<i>Amamiya izan ote zen?</i>

219
00:14:27,408 --> 00:14:28,701
<i>Kasu horretan…</i>

220
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:31,871
Koyuki, orain duzu aukera.

221
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:32,955
Tsukko!

222
00:14:33,038 --> 00:14:38,252
{\an8}Bete ezazu bihotzean duen hutsune hori
orain lur jota dagoela, eta gero…

223
00:14:38,335 --> 00:14:40,462
{\an8}Bai! Aurrera, Koyun!

224
00:14:47,011 --> 00:14:51,348
<i>Bihotzean duen hutsunea betetzea
zuzenena izango litzateke</i>

225
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:53,225
<i>bihotza hautsita balu.</i>

226
00:14:55,311 --> 00:14:57,563
Koyukik Igarashirekin moztu du, antza.

227
00:14:57,646 --> 00:15:00,316
Zer? Baina oso ondo zeuden, ez?

228
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:05,070
<i>Baina errudun sentitzen bada
edo bere burua zigortzen badu,</i>

229
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:10,576
<i>Amamiyari laguntzeko
ezer egin al dezaket nik?</i>

230
00:15:12,786 --> 00:15:15,331
{\an8}Aizu, egia da Kurikirekin moztu duzula?

231
00:15:15,414 --> 00:15:16,582
Bai.

232
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:19,835
Axola zaizu orain ni saiatzen banaiz?

233
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:22,254
Edo gaizki ikusten duzu?

234
00:15:22,338 --> 00:15:23,589
Ez, lasai.

235
00:15:24,590 --> 00:15:27,468
Ez nago inori zer egin behar duen
esateko moduan.

236
00:15:27,551 --> 00:15:31,055
Bueno, zu ezagututa,
neska berria aurkituko duzu laster.

237
00:15:31,138 --> 00:15:31,972
KAR-KAR

238
00:15:38,604 --> 00:15:40,272
Azumi!

239
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,525
Zer, Akahoshi?

240
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:44,944
Zer moduz Amamiya?

241
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:48,030
Lur jota jarraitzen du.

242
00:15:48,113 --> 00:15:49,114
Bai, e?

243
00:15:49,198 --> 00:15:52,368
{\an8}Ba asteburu honetan bere urtebetetzea da.

244
00:15:54,453 --> 00:15:55,829
{\an8}A bai?

245
00:15:55,913 --> 00:15:59,124
{\an8}Bai, badakit. Zorigaiztokoa gure mutila.

246
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:02,211
Ospatzeko
horrelako zerbait egitea pentsatu dut,

247
00:16:02,294 --> 00:16:04,380
baina ni ez naiz oso trebea.

248
00:16:04,463 --> 00:16:07,132
{\an8}A zer ideia bikaina!

249
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:09,885
- Honek animatuko du.
- Bai, ezta?

250
00:16:10,469 --> 00:16:12,721
Baina dibertigarria izan behar du.

251
00:16:12,805 --> 00:16:14,682
- Bale.
- Zertan zabiltzate?

252
00:16:14,765 --> 00:16:15,766
MIDORIKAWA AGERTU DA

253
00:16:17,685 --> 00:16:18,894
Bale, orduan…

254
00:16:19,853 --> 00:16:22,815
Urtebetetze festa sorpresa!

255
00:16:23,857 --> 00:16:26,735
Gauza batzuk erosiko ditugu.

256
00:16:26,819 --> 00:16:28,028
- Bai!
- Bai!

257
00:16:28,112 --> 00:16:29,947
Minatori bat erosiko diogu?

258
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,490
- Hau?
- Ez dugu behar.

259
00:16:31,573 --> 00:16:34,034
KAR-KAR

260
00:16:35,411 --> 00:16:37,538
Gaur ez duzue klubeko jarduerarik?

261
00:16:37,621 --> 00:16:41,000
Kultur jaialdia amaitu denez,
ez dugu asko egiten.

262
00:16:41,083 --> 00:16:44,336
Eta musika taldean bakoitza bere kasa doa.

263
00:16:49,216 --> 00:16:50,843
Yotak libre dagoela dio.

264
00:16:50,926 --> 00:16:51,927
Gonbidatuko diot?

265
00:16:54,471 --> 00:16:56,181
<i>A zer sustoa.</i>

266
00:16:56,807 --> 00:17:00,561
<i>Baina ez nuke bere inguruan
beti urduri egon behar.</i>

267
00:17:01,145 --> 00:17:03,564
<i>Berak ja gainditu du.</i>

268
00:17:03,647 --> 00:17:05,065
<i>Iragana da.</i>

269
00:17:05,149 --> 00:17:08,819
{\an8}<i>Eta zakarra da kontuari
garrantzi handia ematen jarraitzea.</i>

270
00:17:12,781 --> 00:17:14,199
PANP

271
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:16,285
<i>Uste dut…</i>

272
00:17:16,368 --> 00:17:17,453
TAUP-TAUP
ZURRUPAKA

273
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:22,833
{\an8}Zu pozik egotea besterik ez du nahi Yotak.

274
00:17:23,459 --> 00:17:26,462
Bere helburua ez da
zuk bera zoriontsu egitea.

275
00:17:27,212 --> 00:17:30,257
{\an8}Niretzat zu Miki zara, eta kito.

276
00:17:32,843 --> 00:17:35,345
<i>Geldi! Ez pentsatu horretan orain!</i>

277
00:17:35,429 --> 00:17:37,389
Oso jatun ona zara, Yota.

278
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:41,560
Bueno, gu hemendik goaz.

279
00:17:43,353 --> 00:17:44,980
A bai?

280
00:17:45,064 --> 00:17:47,983
- Agur.
- Bihar arte!

281
00:17:49,777 --> 00:17:52,071
Etxera zoaz?
Zati bat elkarrekin egin dezakegu.

282
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:53,655
Bale…

283
00:18:03,082 --> 00:18:05,250
<i>Biok bakarrik gaude.</i>

284
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:06,502
<i>Ai ama…</i>

285
00:18:07,377 --> 00:18:09,254
<i>Zer egin dezaket?</i>

286
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:13,133
<i>Hau ez zait gustatzen.
Ez dut sentimendu hau gogoko.</i>

287
00:18:13,967 --> 00:18:16,470
<i>Arraroa dagoena ni naizela dirudi.</i>

288
00:18:17,096 --> 00:18:19,014
<i>Ezin dudala natural jokatu.</i>

289
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:23,894
<i>Baina lehen ondo nengoen.</i>

290
00:18:31,068 --> 00:18:33,112
- Hori katu bat zen?
- Non?

291
00:18:33,195 --> 00:18:35,405
Animaliaren bat ikusi dut.

292
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:37,449
Ikustera joango gara?

293
00:18:37,533 --> 00:18:42,037
Zer izango zen? Ai, hau zirrara.
Eta <i>tsuchinoko</i>-ren bat bazen?

294
00:18:44,832 --> 00:18:46,125
Begira! Hortxe dago.

295
00:18:47,292 --> 00:18:49,169
TINKO BEGIRA

296
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:51,672
Ikusmena aztertu behar duzu?

297
00:18:51,755 --> 00:18:52,923
ISILEAN

298
00:18:53,006 --> 00:18:54,174
Hiru, bi, bat…

299
00:18:54,258 --> 00:18:55,551
FIU

300
00:18:55,634 --> 00:18:58,387
AIREAN FLOTATZEN

301
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:00,055
LANDARE BIRAKARIA

302
00:19:03,142 --> 00:19:04,143
{\an8}Zer da hori?

303
00:19:08,981 --> 00:19:10,691
{\an8}Ez, baina…

304
00:19:10,774 --> 00:19:13,235
Bizirik zegoela zirudien.

305
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,444
Hau?

306
00:19:14,528 --> 00:19:15,529
AIREAN FLOTATZEN

307
00:19:17,781 --> 00:19:19,199
Zer demontre da hau?

308
00:19:19,283 --> 00:19:20,576
Ideiarik ez!

309
00:19:20,659 --> 00:19:23,203
<i>Cowboy filmen gauza bat zela uste nuen.</i>

310
00:19:24,163 --> 00:19:25,164
EA, EA

311
00:19:25,247 --> 00:19:27,583
Maite dudala uste dut. Lasai, txikitxo.

312
00:19:36,049 --> 00:19:37,593
<i>Banekien nik.</i>

313
00:19:39,428 --> 00:19:41,305
<i>Yotarekin egotea gogoko dut.</i>

314
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:46,059
<i>Aterarazten duen nire bertsioa gogoko dut.</i>

315
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:49,271
<i>Yota gogoko dut.</i>

316
00:19:51,356 --> 00:19:53,692
<i>Ez bakarrik bikotekide edo lagun gisa.</i>

317
00:19:54,359 --> 00:19:55,903
<i>Bera denagatik gogoko dut.</i>

318
00:19:57,404 --> 00:19:59,281
<i>Oso sinplea da.</i>

319
00:20:00,073 --> 00:20:02,367
<i>Horrelaxe izan behar zuen.</i>

320
00:20:02,993 --> 00:20:06,705
<i>Orduan, zergatik eman dizkiot
hainbeste buelta?</i>

321
00:20:08,457 --> 00:20:10,792
Bueno, ederki pasa dugu.

322
00:20:10,876 --> 00:20:11,877
Bagoaz?

323
00:20:13,587 --> 00:20:16,381
- Agur, Pokojiro.
- Pokotaren anaia txikia?

324
00:20:18,717 --> 00:20:20,552
Tira, animo…

325
00:20:20,636 --> 00:20:22,304
Ene, gogorragoa da igotzea.

326
00:20:22,387 --> 00:20:23,388
Bai.

327
00:20:27,935 --> 00:20:28,936
Eutsi gogor.

328
00:20:30,938 --> 00:20:33,106
Ondo zaude? Kontuz.

329
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:34,358
Bai.

330
00:20:34,983 --> 00:20:36,360
Eskerrik asko.

331
00:20:41,865 --> 00:20:42,866
Prest?

332
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,368
Salto!

333
00:20:45,869 --> 00:20:47,454
Ezustean harrapatu nau.

334
00:20:47,537 --> 00:20:48,997
Ez kezkatu.

335
00:20:49,581 --> 00:20:52,000
<i>Ez berotu burua.</i>

336
00:20:52,084 --> 00:20:53,752
<i>Erraza. Ez konplikatu.</i>

337
00:21:00,842 --> 00:21:02,511
{\an8}<i>- Haize leuna…</i>
- Hara.

338
00:21:03,136 --> 00:21:04,638
Haize leun hau maite dut.

339
00:21:07,224 --> 00:21:08,558
Udazkena iristear da.

340
00:21:09,768 --> 00:21:11,353
Irrikatan nago. Zu ez?

341
00:21:11,895 --> 00:21:16,441
Baina horrelako uneak, hotza egiten hasi
eta urtaro aldaketa nabari denean,

342
00:21:16,525 --> 00:21:18,777
gehien atsegin ditudanak dira.

343
00:21:21,613 --> 00:21:22,614
<i>Ui…</i>

344
00:21:24,491 --> 00:21:26,994
<i>Ukaezina da.</i>

345
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:31,790
<i>Itxaron, bai zera… Zer?</i>

346
00:21:31,873 --> 00:21:34,126
<i>Ez. Ezin liteke.</i>

347
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,088
Bihar arte.

348
00:22:00,068 --> 00:22:03,405
<i>Primeran pasa dugu.
Irribarrea kendu ezinik nago.</i>

349
00:22:04,948 --> 00:22:10,746
<i>Arin sentitzen naiz, airean flotatzen,
zirrarak eta nerbioak jota.</i>

350
00:22:11,705 --> 00:22:16,251
<i>Baina bihotza eztarrian daukat.
Negarrez hastear banengo bezala.</i>

351
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:19,421
<i>Zer egingo dut?</i>

352
00:22:20,422 --> 00:22:22,883
<i>Hau maitasuna da, argi eta garbi.</i>

353
00:23:50,929 --> 00:23:55,934
Azpitituluak: Loinaz C. A.

